      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1350327982,
      "version": 198,
      "versionNonce": 1111426399,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789697610119,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "        \n通过这种方法，可以创建master&slaver的形态\nfor ranks in group_ranks:\n    device_group = torch.distributed.new_group(\n                ranks, backend=torch_distributed_backend\n            )",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "        \n通过这种方法，可以创建master&slaver的形态\nfor ranks in group_ranks:\n    device_group = torch.distributed.new_group(\n                ranks, backend=torch_distributed_backend\n            )",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vCtB4P8b15YTwbKJzIVQ5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2837.6828906968963,
      "y": 2417.417397772055,
      "width": 549.6998291015625,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 512309106,
      "version": 113,
      "versionNonce": 1227211793,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789697610119,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "init_distributed_environment\n配置适配：\n如果存在vLLM配置且需要数据并行，会调整rank和world_size\n根据节点数选择正确的IP和端口初始化方法\n分布式初始化：\n检查PyTorch分布式是否已初始化\n如果未初始化，使用init_process_group初始化\n处理后端回退逻辑（NCCL不可用时回退到Gloo）\n特殊模式支持：\n弹性执行体并行（Elastic EP）支持\n多节点TP/PP检查\n组管理：\n初始化全局进程组\n根据配置初始化内部数据并行组\n记录节点数量\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "init_distributed_environment\n配置适配：\n如果存在vLLM配置且需要数据并行，会调整rank和world_size\n根据节点数选择正确的IP和端口初始化方法\n分布式初始化：\n检查PyTorch分布式是否已初始化\n如果未初始化，使用init_process_group初始化\n处理后端回退逻辑（NCCL不可用时回退到Gloo）\n特殊模式支持：\n弹性执行体并行（Elastic EP）支持\n多节点TP/PP检查\n组管理：\n初始化全局进程组\n根据配置初始化内部数据并行组\n记录节点数量\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
