      "text": "① OS sentinel 监控线程\n\nFrontend: MPClientEngineMonitor\n每 1s 轮询各 EngineCore 的 sentinel\nEngineCore: MultiprocWorkerMonitor\nwait 全部 worker 的 sentinel\nexitcode != 0 → 全组 shutdown (fail-fast)",
      "originalText": "① OS sentinel 监控线程\n\nFrontend: MPClientEngineMonitor\n每 1s 轮询各 EngineCore 的 sentinel\nEngineCore: MultiprocWorkerMonitor\nwait 全部 worker 的 sentinel\nexitcode != 0 → 全组 shutdown (fail-fast)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "upBYL6BBBszZzRWxM4sE0",
