      "updated": 1789697610120,
      "text": "② 主动死亡广播\n\nEngineCore 退出前 PUSH \"ENGINE_CORE_DEAD\"\n(ZMQ linger=4s 保证送达)\nFrontend validate_alive → EngineDeadError\n在途请求立刻失败, 不等轮询",
      "originalText": "② 主动死亡广播\n\nEngineCore 退出前 PUSH \"ENGINE_CORE_DEAD\"\n(ZMQ linger=4s 保证送达)\nFrontend validate_alive → EngineDeadError\n在途请求立刻失败, 不等轮询",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "fp9TJg1CcaTXLvmZAghmz",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "bB7",
      "roundness": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
