      "text": "③ 双向管道探活\n\nWorker 阻塞读 death_pipe:\n父进程死 → EOFError → 子进程自杀\n(worker 为 daemon=True, 双保险)\n启动期 ready pipe 带超时等待",
      "originalText": "③ 双向管道探活\n\nWorker 阻塞读 death_pipe:\n父进程死 → EOFError → 子进程自杀\n(worker 为 daemon=True, 双保险)\n启动期 ready pipe 带超时等待",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Pi3nwF5Dslm0hlLSIIrjv",
