      "updated": 1789697610120,
      "text": "补充\nSIGTERM → SignalCallback (信号转专用线程) → ZMQ PAIR shutdown / kill 子进程列表; CoreEngineProcManager 挂 weakref.finalize 兜底清理\nDPCoordinator 管请求路由 (stats 负载均衡 / MoE wave 协调), 不负责进程心跳\n当前语义: 单点故障 = 全组下线, 无自动重启 (elastic / fault-tolerant EP 为 future work)",
      "originalText": "补充\nSIGTERM → SignalCallback (信号转专用线程) → ZMQ PAIR shutdown / kill 子进程列表; CoreEngineProcManager 挂 weakref.finalize 兜底清理\nDPCoordinator 管请求路由 (stats 负载均衡 / MoE wave 协调), 不负责进程心跳\n当前语义: 单点故障 = 全组下线, 无自动重启 (elastic / fault-tolerant EP 为 future work)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "QyfDlDKtwsdJHyNM2wCWF",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
