      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789697610120,
      "text": "① Frontend <-> EngineCore\n单机: ZMQ ipc:// (Unix domain socket)\n多机: 自动切换 tcp:// (client_local_only=False)\n地址经 handshake 协商: bind 后回报内核端口\n(headless 节点的 EngineCore 反向连接 rank0)",
      "originalText": "① Frontend <-> EngineCore\n单机: ZMQ ipc:// (Unix domain socket)\n多机: 自动切换 tcp:// (client_local_only=False)\n地址经 handshake 协商: bind 后回报内核端口\n(headless 节点的 EngineCore 反向连接 rank0)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
