      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789697610120,
      "text": "② SchedulerOutput 跨机广播 (nnodes_within_dp>1)\n混合 MessageQueue:\n· 本地 reader: shm ring buffer + ipc:// ZMQ XPUB\n· 远端 reader: tcp:// ZMQ XPUB (handle 经 gloo CPU 组\n  broadcast_object_list 交换)\nWorkerOutput 经单读者 MQ 广播回 driver worker",
      "originalText": "② SchedulerOutput 跨机广播 (nnodes_within_dp>1)\n混合 MessageQueue:\n· 本地 reader: shm ring buffer + ipc:// ZMQ XPUB\n· 远端 reader: tcp:// ZMQ XPUB (handle 经 gloo CPU 组\n  broadcast_object_list 交换)\nWorkerOutput 经单读者 MQ 广播回 driver worker",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
