      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789697610120,
      "text": "③ TP 张量并行通信\n本机: NCCL / Custom AllReduce (NVLink · P2P)\n跨机: NCCL 走 RDMA (InfiniBand / RoCE) 或以太网\ninit: tcp:// rendezvous (distributed_init_method)\n(本例 TP=8 不跨机; 单副本跨机时才有此开销)",
      "originalText": "③ TP 张量并行通信\n本机: NCCL / Custom AllReduce (NVLink · P2P)\n跨机: NCCL 走 RDMA (InfiniBand / RoCE) 或以太网\ninit: tcp:// rendezvous (distributed_init_method)\n(本例 TP=8 不跨机; 单副本跨机时才有此开销)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
