      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789697610120,
      "text": "④ 拉起方式\n非 Ray: 每节点一个 vllm serve\n(--data-parallel-address = rank0 节点 IP)\nRay: 单命令拉起全部 rank\nEngineCore -> EngineCoreActor (placement group span)\nWorker -> Ray actor, 生命周期交 Ray 管理",
      "originalText": "④ 拉起方式\n非 Ray: 每节点一个 vllm serve\n(--data-parallel-address = rank0 节点 IP)\nRay: 单命令拉起全部 rank\nEngineCore -> EngineCoreActor (placement group span)\nWorker -> Ray actor, 生命周期交 Ray 管理",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
